---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Conditions - AspectRatioKit | User Agreement"
  description="Read the terms of service and conditions for using AspectRatioKit's free in-browser aspect ratio calculator and image tools."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
  activeNav="/terms"
>
  <div class="py-16 bg-[#fafafa] dark:bg-[#0a0a0a] border-b border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] transition-colors duration-150">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white dark:bg-[#141414] border border-[#ebebeb] dark:border-[#262626] text-xs font-mono uppercase text-[#0070f3] mb-4">
        <span>Legal Terms</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[#171717] dark:text-white">
        Terms &amp; Conditions
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1]">
        Last revised: September 2026. Please review these terms prior to using AspectRatioKit.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 space-y-10 text-sm text-[#4d4d4d] dark:text-[#a1a1a1] leading-relaxed">
    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">1. Agreement to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        By accessing or using <strong>AspectRatioKit</strong> ("the Service", available at <code class="font-mono text-xs">aspectratiokit.pages.dev</code>), you agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use the website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">2. License &amp; Permitted Use</h2>
      <p>
        AspectRatioKit grants you a personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, revocable license to access and use our aspect ratio calculators, resolution tables, crop framing solvers, and educational guides for both personal and commercial creative work.
      </p>
      <p>
        You agree not to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1">
        <li>Attempt to disrupt, overload, or compromise the stability of our web infrastructure;</li>
        <li>Automate scraping or extraction of our website assets in a manner that degrades service performance for others;</li>
        <li>Misrepresent AspectRatioKit as your own proprietary software.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">3. Intellectual Property Rights</h2>
      <p>
        All original code, software algorithms, UI components, documentation, graphic marks, and styling of AspectRatioKit are the exclusive intellectual property of AspectRatioKit and its creators, protected by applicable copyright and trademark laws.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Your Content:</strong> All images, photographs, and media you inspect with our tools remain 100% your property. We claim zero ownership or rights over any images processed in your browser.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
      <p>
        The Service is provided on an "AS IS" and "AS AVAILABLE" basis without warranties of any kind, whether express or implied. While we strive for absolute mathematical precision in all aspect ratio and resolution computations, we do not warrant that calculations will be error-free or that the site will be uninterrupted.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>
        In no event shall AspectRatioKit, its operators, or affiliates be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages resulting from your use of or inability to use the tools or materials on this website.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">6. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>
        We reserve the right to revise these Terms &amp; Conditions at our sole discretion. Any changes will become effective immediately upon posting to this page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-3">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[#171717] dark:text-white">7. Contact Information</h2>
      <p>
        For inquiries regarding these Terms, please reach out via our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#0070f3] hover:underline">Contact Page</a> or write to <code class="font-mono text-xs">legal@aspectratiokit.pages.dev</code>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
